## Interface: 11509, 16001, 20506
## Title: Kill on Sight
## Notes: A guild kill list with bank-escrowed bounties. Enemies who kill a guild member go on the board automatically, with a shared feed of who killed whom; right-click a name to start a pending bounty job that goes live only when its gold is in the guild bank. Every bounty asks 3g, the killer is owed 70%, the bank keeps 30%, the last known spot becomes an addon-only map pin and is shared with the bounty, and an unclaimed bounty goes back to its payer after a week.
